            "notes": "**\ud83c\udf1f Starting Choices (Round 1)** I always start with:\n\n-+5% Attack Power \u2694\ufe0f\n\n-+5% Attack Speed \ud83c\udff9\n\n-Faster Regeneration \ud83c\udf31\n\n**\ud83d\udca1 Why these picks?**\n\n**Attack Power + Speed** \u2192 lets you punish enemies who get out of position with quick, high-DPS headshots.\n\n**Regeneration** \u2192 since enemies usually won\u2019t shoot you, instead they typically will go for your clones, you have time to reposition while recovering health, giving you more sustain early on.",
