            "notes": "**\u26a1 Round 2 \u2013 Power Spike** By this point, you\u2019ll usually have enough money to grab  [Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b) \ud83c\udf69.\n\n**\ud83d\udca1 Why Donut Delivery?**\nIt\u2019s a massive boost to your healing, letting your tp heals in AREA.\n\n**\ud83d\udcb0 If you\u2019re short on cash (\u2248 8500)**\nGo for 2x CDR items instead:\n\n- [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56)\ud83d\udd27\n\n- [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f\n\nWith these, you\u2019ll be spawning clones faster \u2192 which means more healing, more survivability, and more gold flow \ud83d\udcb8 to hit your next core items.\n\n**NOTE:** Sometimes I go with [ [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f)  to do more dmg to some heroes like ASHE",
