            "notes": "**\u26a1 Round 3 \u2013 The Annoying Lifesaver**\n\nThis is where your build really starts to frustrate the enemy team \ud83d\ude08.\n\n\ud83c\udfaf Core Pickup:\n\n- [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b) \ud83c\udf00\n\n**\ud83d\udca1 Why Two-Zu?**\n\n- Spawning extra **Suzus + clones** = nonstop cleansing + heals.\n\n- Removes nasty effects like **Ashe Burn \ud83d\udd25**, **Ana Nade \ud83d\udc89**, and other debuffs.\n\nKeeps your team alive longer than they should be \ud83d\udcaa.\n\n**\u2699\ufe0f Complementary Picks:**\nStack more **Cooldown Reduction (CDR) \u23f3** such as  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) (too bost your healing through Donut Delivery) or  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) (if you are receiving a lot of dmg) so you can cycle clones and Suzus faster \u2192 turning you into a healing machine with anti-debuff spam.",
