            "notes": "**\u26a1 Round 4 \u2013 Absolute Menace Mode \u26a1**\n\nYour clone\u2019s now about a 4-second terror machine thanks to **30% CDR**, and with \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56)  + \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) , you\u2019re officially the nightmare in their lane.\n\n**\ud83d\udc6f Clone Spam:** Every 4 seconds, a mini-you pops up. They don\u2019t need to deal huge damage\u2014just exist. Steal attention, confuse enemies\u2026 chaos incarnate.\n\n**\ud83d\udd35 Blue Item Buffs:** Multi-Tool adds extra poke & utility, while Ironclad Exhaust Ports gives durability and a tiny **\u2728AP boost\u2728** for your donut heals \ud83c\udf69\u2014making those heals slightly more spiteful.\n\n**\ud83d\ude08 Annoyance Layering:** Place clones smartly: one baits, one pokes, one just chills to confuse target selection. The enemy will start wasting skills on clones\u2026 exactly as intended.\n\n**\ud83d\udca1 Pro Tip:** Keep moving, drop clones\u2014maximize chaos.",
