            "notes": "**\ud83c\udfdf\ufe0f Round 7 \u2013 Full Stadium Domination & Maximum Annoyance \ud83c\udfdf\ufe0f**\n\nIf you\u2019ve made it this far, congratulations\u2014you\u2019re about to show the world just how **insanely annoying Kiriko can be.** Your clones? Relentless distractions. Your heals? Enough to keep the whole team alive in the stadium by yourself \ud83c\udf69\u2728.\n\n**\u26a1 Last Power Choice:**\n\nYou\u2019ve got a hard decision for your ultimate utility:\n\n-[Supported Shooting](item_4a084906-0fcd-4158-9a4b-763a69d0b198)  \u2013 boosts your team\u2019s attack speed. Ideal if you need to pressure the enemy or counter their build/playstyle.\n\n-[Leaf on the Wind](item_b64de259-d122-407d-a7e4-9d7267310704)  \u2013 ramps up your healing even further, consistently hitting 10k heals like slicing butter with a hot knife. Perfect for pure team sustain.\n\n**\u26a1 Power Adjustments:**\n\nIf your build isn\u2019t working or you need extra support, you might drop to 40% CDR. This means clones spawn every 4 seconds instead of 3\u2014but fear not, the support tools compensate:\n\n-[Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718)  \u2192 your suzus now provide **100 HP overheal,** scaling with AP \ud83d\udc96.\n\n-[Talisman of Velocity](item_9b81fbe9-c5f8-4442-93d5-082b036010a1) \u2192 gives attack and movement speed to whoever you hit with a Suzu \u26a1. Imagine the sheer overpower potential your team will have.\n\n**\ud83d\udca1 Mindset:**\n\n-Spawn clones, throw suzus, heal like a legend, and keep enemies spinning in chaos.\n\n-Make every ability, every item, every clone count. You\u2019re no longer just annoying\u2014you\u2019re a walking, unstoppable support and menace combo.\n\n**\ud83d\ude0e Pro Tip:** Rotate between damage support and healing support depending on your team\u2019s needs. With Talisman of Life + Velocity + Leaf on the Wind, your team becomes **an unstoppable storm of buffs and heals,** while enemies suffer the ultimate annoyance of Kiriko\u2019s chaotic mastery.\n\nIn the video I have at the build description, you can see this exact build in action. Look at the insane synergy with Reinhardt\u2014clones, heals, buffs, and slows all working together to turn your team into a nearly unstoppable force while making the enemy wish they never queued.",
